{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don\u2019t be the chew toy. Don\u2019t be the chew toy. Don\u2019t be the chew toy. Don\u2019t be the chew toy...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your gang. Loot some houses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, sure. Except these houses are in the strangest neighborhood in the world, filled with bizarre mutations of science\u2026 and the Good Boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Good Boy?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op horror comedy for up to six players, where you and your friends attempt to gather piles of epic loot without making noise (and summoning the mutated pets that defend the town). Make it back to your hideout with your ill gotten gains, split the cash, upgrade your burglar hideout, and grow your infamy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, we can\u2019t guarantee there will be any survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Please note, Good Boy runs on the Steam Deck, but performance has not been fully optimized in this early access phase. Try at your own risk!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670740?t=1763160030","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670740/a0a7d803876858e20526cf97b7fca78af2dc840f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763160030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670740/14e3faab69f1077ddd795318cbe2157a6175b86f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763160030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670740/14e3faab69f1077ddd795318cbe2157a6175b86f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763160030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Good Boy is a comedy horror, and some elements may be scary for younger players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don\u2019t be the chew toy. Don\u2019t be the chew toy. Don\u2019t be the chew toy. Don\u2019t be the chew toy...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your gang. Loot some houses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, sure. Except these houses are in the strangest neighborhood in the world, filled with bizarre mutations of science\u2026 and the Good Boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Good Boy?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op horror comedy for up to six players, where you and your friends attempt to gather piles of epic loot without making noise (and summoning the mutated pets that defend the town). Make it back to your hideout with your ill gotten gains, split the cash, upgrade your burglar hideout, and grow your infamy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, we can\u2019t guarantee there will be any survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Please note, Good Boy runs on the Steam Deck, but performance has not been fully optimized in this early access phase. Try at your own risk!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Terrible Posture Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670740/b91ed41eb4824bc5bd2ef50ab16515e33e0fc4f9/header.jpg?t=1763160